<Portfolio title="Game Torch" description="An experimental game discovery platform and the first shipped Aesthetic Engine product. Explore curated horror games through a minecart interface."><section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Experimental game discovery platform</p><h1>Game Torch</h1><p class="lead">Finding your next game becomes a little adventure of its own.</p><p>The first shipped Aesthetic Engine product explores a different interface for discovery: ride into a mine, find horror games, and keep the ones that catch your attention.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://aestheticengine.itch.io/game-torch">Get Game Torch ↗</a></div></section><figure class="wide-image"><img src="/images/torch.jpeg" alt="A vivid crystal mine and rail track in Game Torch" width="794" height="446"/><figcaption>GAME TORCH / A minecart journey through curated horror games.</figcaption></figure>
